    {
      "id": "Q4",
      "themeId": "CW-084",
      "order": 4,
      "type": "self_analysis_kbat",
      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: fear of loss",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：管理亏损恐惧而不回避有效形态"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of managing fear of loss without avoiding valid setups using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
